title: Cloudy_Complete
---
<<playvoice "Cloudy/CloudyLine10">><<play_anim "Talk">>
Cloudy: They're home! Oh, thank you! I can't believe they're really back...
<<play_anim "IdleHappy">><<stopvoice>>
<<playvoice "Cloudy/CloudyLine11">><<play_anim "Talk">>
Cloudy: I'll come to the party, and I'll bring my best friends. The penguins love parties.
<<play_anim "IdleHappy">><<stopvoice>>
<<complete_quest "Penguin search">>
